  "vibe": "Sunrise ballooning in peach and burnt orange. A #f6d8c3 dawn-paper ground, Chonburi's rounded decorative serif in #33232a, and #d95d39 doing every piece of accent work. The world is literal: a hot-air balloon rises in step with the scene's own progress, white gore lines curving over the envelope, a wicker basket swinging on ropes below, and a burner flame that pulses in place; three white clouds drift past at staggered speeds over a brown hill silhouette with tiny bird ticks. Statement beats cut the world away entirely and go full #9fc4d8 morning blue; the CTA goes solid burnt orange with an ink pill. Camera work is calm — pushes, one small hop, a lazy drift — and everything enters by rising. Owns bar Rings, switch Toggles, fade Morphs and a slider Cursor. For tour operators, resorts, retreats and anything sold at first light.",
